[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0895","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0895.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0752","title":"FreeBSD brouted 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中的 brouted（路由守护进程）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该程序传递超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 及其他可能使用该组件的操作系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0752"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.447","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 系统至 3.5-RELEASE 或更高版本，该版本已修复 brouted 缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可下载 FreeBSD 安全公告中的补丁文件手动修补 brouted 源码并重新编译安装。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 brouted 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/brouted）以限制本地普通用户触发提权，但此操作会影响路由守护进程的正常功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0339.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1629","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0752","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0752.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rrcq-rghp-hjgx/GHSA-rrcq-rghp-hjgx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1629/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0752.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a3ed07c0-7e45-48da-b88b-d6aa16a59fb3.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0895.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0894","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0894.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0749","title":"FreeBSD Linux 二进制兼容模块缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.x 至 5.x 版本的 Linux 二进制兼容模块中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 Linux shadow 文件系统中构造超长文件名触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击条件为拥有本地访问权限，无需其他特殊条件即可提权至最高权限，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0749"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.050","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 至 4.1-RELEASE 或更高版本，该版本已修复 linux binary compatibility 模块中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可应用 FreeBSD-SA-00:41 安全公告中的补丁，修改 sys/compat/linux/linux_misc.c 中对 shadow 文件系统文件名长度的检查逻辑，限制文件名长度防止缓冲区溢出。临时缓解措施可禁用 Linux 二进制兼容模块（在 /etc/rc.conf 中设置 linux_enable=\"NO\" 并重启）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0338.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1536","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1628","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5968","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0749","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0749.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8h7q-8fjc-rcf2/GHSA-8h7q-8fjc-rcf2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5be98370-ddc6-4cf9-bf90-01f6e6334bbf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0749.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3944e09fb28929da2e246a8b27f3b2564782fb22/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0894.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0893","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0893.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0748","title":"OpenLDAP ud 权限配置不当漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 1.2.11 及更早版本在安装 ud 二进制文件时错误地设置了群组可写权限，导致该群组中的任意用户可将 ud 文件替换为特洛伊木马程序。攻击者只需拥有目标系统上的本地群组账号即可利用此漏洞，通过替换 ud 二进制实现权限提升或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响范围广，利用条件低，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0748"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23.930","remediation":"立即修复 `ud` 二进制文件的权限：执行 `chmod 755 /path/to/ud` 移除组写权限。升级 OpenLDAP 至 1.2.12 或更高版本。如无法升级，使用 `chmod g-w /path/to/ud` 移除组写权限，并检查 `/etc/group` 中哪些用户属于该组，移除不必要的组成员。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0375.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1511","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0748","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0748.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ad1f28a6575460b2b8dc02e086c9a35eb31ea1f4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r458-gcmr-cw5r/GHSA-r458-gcmr-cw5r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--59c4d7e8-f339-4b68-a5d9-b69de1ec768d.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0748.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3944e09fb28929da2e246a8b27f3b2564782fb22/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0893.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0892","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0892.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0800","title":"SuSE Linux linuxnfs/knfsd rpc.kstatd 远程权限提升漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 及其他使用 linuxnfs/knfsd 包的系统中，rpc.kstatd 服务存在字符串格式化解析漏洞。由于程序在处理用户输入时未正确验证格式化字符串，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送精心构造的恶意 RPC 请求，触发格式化字符串漏洞实现任意代码执行，从而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 及所有部署了受影响版本 knfsd/nfs-utils 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属于最高危级别。攻击者无需本地访问权限即可远程利用，危害极大。建议尽快升级至修复版本的 nfs-utils 或 knfsd 包，并限制 rpc 服务的网络暴露面。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0800"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.447","remediation":"根据 SuSE Security Announcement #58（2000年10月），建议立即升级 SuSE Linux 的 linuxnfs 或 knfsd 软件包至 SuSE 官方发布的安全补丁版本，可通过 SuSE 的 YaST 在线更新工具或 FTP 镜像站点获取修复后的 nfs-utils 和 knfsd 相关 RPM 包。如暂无法立即打补丁，应在防火墙或 iptables 规则中限制对 rpc.kstatd 服务端口（端口 111 及 NFS 相关端口）的访问，仅允许受信任网络的主机访问。同时建议在禁用的服务列表中将 nfs 和 statd 相关启动脚本设为不自动启动，以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_58.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0800","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0800.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fjq5-vvr8-jg5f/GHSA-fjq5-vvr8-jg5f.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/secpod_nfs_rpc_statd_mult_format_string_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f7052837-e03e-4eed-a5aa-b19f2a57e92d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0892.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0891","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0891.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0750","title":"NetBSD mopd 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NetBSD 系统中的 mopd（维护操作协议加载器守护进程）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 mopd 服务发送包含超长文件名的特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多版本 NetBSD 及类 Unix 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害严重。建议受影响的系统立即升级或禁用 mopd 服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0750"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.187","remediation":"立即升级 NetBSD 系统至包含 mopd 补丁的版本（process.c r1.8），或从 http://cvsweb.netbsd.org/bsdweb.cgi/basesrc/usr.sbin/mopd/mopd/process.c.diff?r1=1.7&r2=1.8 获取补丁手动编译；OpenBSD 用户应用 errata#mopd 补丁；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000-050 更新。如业务不需要 mopd 服务，建议直接禁用或移除 mopd 守护进程，并在防火墙上限制对 mopd 端口（UDP 68）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0064.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0336.html","http://cvsweb.netbsd.org/bsdweb.cgi/basesrc/usr.sbin/mopd/mopd/process.c.diff?r1=1.7&r2=1.8&f=h","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#mopd","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-050.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1558","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0750","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0750.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cfgx-7qv4-jhxr/GHSA-cfgx-7qv4-jhxr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2a0bc273-cf2e-4c7b-9d60-f68437f46425.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0750.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--2a0bc273-cf2e-4c7b-9d60-f68437f46425.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0891.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0890","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0890.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0744","title":"University of Minnesota Gopherd 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0744 是 CVE-2000-0743 的重复编号。后者描述的是明尼苏达大学（UMN）Gopher 服务程序 gopherd 2.x 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 GDESkey（DES 密钥生成请求）接口发送包含超长 ticket 值的特制请求报文，触发栈溢出，从而在目标服务器上以 gopherd 进程权限执行任意代码。攻击无需任何身份认证，CVSS v2 评分 10.0，危害等级高危。受影响的版本包括 UMN gopherd 2.x 系列。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0744"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2023-11-07T01:55:23.877","remediation":"建议立即升级 UMN gopherd 至已修复版本（2.x 之后的安全更新），或直接禁用 gopherd 服务。如业务必须使用，在防火墙层面限制对 gopher 端口（70/TCP）的访问，仅允许可信来源 IP 连接，并监控异常请求（如超长 DES key 请求）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0744","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jmhc-44vq-xxm4/GHSA-jmhc-44vq-xxm4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88289/info.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d9e690522c86144671671f4250daa9ba0347e09/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0744.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0890.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0889","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0889.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0742","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 IPX 数据包 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95 及 Windows 98 系统的 IPX 协议实现存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标主机发送源 IP 地址为广播地址的特制 ICMP Ping 数据包，触发目标系统 IPX 协议栈处理异常，导致系统崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 Windows 95 和 Windows 98 操作系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0742"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23.300","remediation":"安装微软 MS00-054 安全公告提供的补丁（Windows 95 下载 265334US5.EXE，Windows 98/98 SE 下载 265334USA8.EXE），补丁使 NWLink 忽略伪造源地址的 IPX Ping 请求。如 NWLink/IPX 协议非业务必需，在「网络属性」中卸载该协议以彻底消除攻击面。同时在网络边界路由器上配置 ACL 丢弃 IPX 协议包（多数互联网路由器默认丢弃 IPX），阻止外部恶意用户向内网发送特制 IPX Ping 报文。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1544","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&mid=63120","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-054","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5079","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0742.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0742","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0742.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0742.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wjpc-9hpw-c7p9/GHSA-wjpc-9hpw-c7p9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c9d3b8ab-261f-416b-b6c9-08db7a766dd8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0742.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3944e09fb28929da2e246a8b27f3b2564782fb22/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0889.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0887","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0887.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0738","title":"Network Associates WebShield SMTP 4.5 邮件地址拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WebShield SMTP 4.5 邮件地址解析存在逻辑缺陷，当远程攻击者发送的邮件地址采用以句点（.）结尾的形式时，系统由于无法正确解析异常地址，导致进入无效循环状态，持续向自身发送邮件副本，造成邮件处理进程资源耗尽。攻击者可通过简单构造的异常邮件触发此漏洞，使目标系统无法正常接收处理邮件，导致服务完全中断。该漏洞影响早期Windows邮件服务器环境，并引发了后续SMTP安全补丁的制定。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0738"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22.790","remediation":"升级 Network Associates WebShield SMTP 至 4.5 以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在邮件网关层配置规则过滤或剔除 From 地址末尾带句点 (.) 的邮件，并在 SMTP 服务器上设置邮件循环检测和最大投递次数限制，防止无限自循环导致拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0101.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1589","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5100"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0887.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0886","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0886.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0736","title":"Becky! Internet Mail 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Becky! Internet Mail 客户端 1.26.04 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户转发邮件时，攻击者可向邮件头部发送超长的 Content-type: MIME 字段触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标邮件客户端崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需复杂认证条件，攻击者可通过构造恶意邮件并诱导目标用户执行转发操作实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0736"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22.547","remediation":"升级至 Becky! Internet Mail 2.x 或更高版本（当前最新为 2.83.03），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。临时缓解措施：在邮件客户端设置中禁用自动转发功能，不转发来源不明的邮件，尤其是包含异常 MIME 头部的邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0234.html","http://member.nifty.ne.jp/rimarts/becky-e/Readme.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0736","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0736.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cq5-57cw-hg4c/GHSA-6cq5-57cw-hg4c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0736.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cf2cf8b3-3763-4328-bd07-22757b1a99d6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f3526cd689b486e2ddce9b934197355bd7bbd3ae/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0886.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0885","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0885.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0735","title":"Becky Internet Mail 客户端缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Becky! Internet Mail 客户端 1.26.03 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户回复包含超长 Content-type MIME 头的恶意邮件时，邮件客户端在处理该头部时未正确验证输入长度，导致缓冲区溢出，造成程序崩溃拒绝服务。攻击者只需构造特制邮件并诱导用户回复即可触发，无需身份认证。该漏洞影响 Becky! Internet Mail 1.26.03 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0735"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22.417","remediation":"立即升级 Becky! Internet Mail 至 1.26.04 或更高版本（当前最新版本为 2.83.03），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如暂时无法升级，建议在邮件客户端设置中关闭自动预览及自动回复功能，不回复来源不明的邮件，并在网络层面对可疑 SMTP/POP3 流量进行深度包检测以拦截恶意载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0234.html","http://member.nifty.ne.jp/rimarts/becky-e/Readme.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0735","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0735.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4g2v-vgjp-2c73/GHSA-4g2v-vgjp-2c73.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0735.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--51ce3067-1a7b-4a90-9f8a-abb2a7282546.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f3526cd689b486e2ddce9b934197355bd7bbd3ae/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0885.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0884","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0884.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0732","title":"Jeremy Arnold Worm Webserver 1.0 URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Jeremy Arnold Worm Webserver 1.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 URL 请求，导致服务器进程崩溃或资源耗尽，无法继续响应正常请求。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，攻击门槛低，影响 Worm Webserver 1.0 版本。由于该软件年代久远且已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0732"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22.003","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 Worm Webserver 1.0，迁移至 Apache、Nginx 等仍在积极更新的 Web 服务器软件。如因特殊原因暂时无法替换，可在反向代理或防火墙上设置 URL 长度限制（建议不超过 2048 字节）并过滤畸形请求以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0111.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1626","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5149","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0732","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0732.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j364-gj4x-7f3p/GHSA-j364-gj4x-7f3p.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0732.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0884.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0883","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0883.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0731","title":"Worm HTTP Server 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Worm HTTP Server 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送包含 `..` 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，突破路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等），影响使用 Worm HTTP Server 的所有版本，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0731"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21.880","remediation":"立即停止使用 Worm HTTP server，该软件已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器，并确保对用户输入路径进行规范化校验，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列的请求。如临时无法替换，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，配置规则拦截包含 .. 的 URL 路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0111.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1535","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1626","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5148","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0731.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0731","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0731.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0731.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xcm3-73w3-h54h/GHSA-xcm3-73w3-h54h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0731.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5a72ea01-3486-47e4-a3d4-d77eb58bc4a4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0883.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0881","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0881.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0729","title":"FreeBSD ELF 映像头解析本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中 ELF 映像加载器未能正确校验 ELF 文件头格式，本地攻击者可执行精心构造的恶意 ELF 二进制程序，触发内核崩溃或资源耗尽，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.x/4.x/5.x 等版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击前提是拥有本地账户权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0729"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21.603","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 4.1.1-RELEASE 或更高版本（该版本修复了 exec_elf_imgact 函数对畸形 ELF 头部的处理），或安装 FreeBSD Security Advisory FreeBSD-SA-00:43 中提供的安全补丁。如无法升级，可通过限制本地用户执行未验证的二进制文件来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0337.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1534","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1625","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5967","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0729","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0729.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-88vq-mwgw-6mcf/GHSA-88vq-mwgw-6mcf.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7bdb7523-4e99-4810-b8cd-485e9e2d8358.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--7bdb7523-4e99-4810-b8cd-485e9e2d8358.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0881.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0880","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0880.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0728","title":"Xpdf PDF Viewer 本地符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"xpdf PDF 查看器客户端 0.91 之前版本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时目录中创建恶意符号链接，诱使 xpdf 在处理 PDF 文件时以当前用户权限将内容写入攻击者指定的任意文件，实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者拥有本地用户权限，影响范围包括 Linux/Unix 系统上使用受影响版本 xpdf 的环境，可导致敏感文件被篡改或系统服务被破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0728"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21.473","remediation":"立即将 xpdf 升级至 0.91 或更高版本。各发行版用户可通过对应包管理器安装更新：Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000:060 提供的更新包，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2000:041 提供的 xpdf-0.91 更新包。如无法立即升级，建议限制本地用户对 xpdf 临时文件的写权限，并避免以 root 身份运行 xpdf 以降低 symlink 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96766355023239&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96886599829687&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-031.0.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1624","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0728","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0728.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3gg5-c54v-vxvr/GHSA-3gg5-c54v-vxvr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a9b7c473-0eb6-42d6-9bdd-98f1f721700e.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/2000/20000910a.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3944e09fb28929da2e246a8b27f3b2564782fb22/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0880.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0879","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0879.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0727","title":"Let me analyze the vulnerability: - CVE-2000-0727 - Product: xpdf PDF viewer (client) - Version: earlier than 0.91 - Issue: Does not properly launch a web browser for embedded URLs, allowing arbitrary command execution via shell metacharacters in URLs - Type: Code execution (命令执行) - AVD description: xpdf 代码执行漏洞 So the title should be: \"xpdf PDF Viewer 远程代码执行漏洞\" Let me verify: - 厂商: xpdf (or the project that makes xpdf) - 产品: PDF Viewer - 漏洞类型: 远程代码执行漏洞 Actually, looking more carefully, the vendor is \"xpdf\" (or the xpdf project). The product is \"PDF Viewer\" (xpdf). The vulnerability type is \"代码执行漏洞\" (code execution via shell metacharacters). Let me think about this more carefully: - Vendor: xpdf - Product: xpdf / PDF Viewer - Type: 远程代码执行漏洞 (remote code execution, since it involves embedded URLs and shell metacharacters) A good title would be: \"xpdf PDF Viewer 远程代码执行漏洞\" Wait, xpdf is both the vendor and product name. Let me keep it simple and accurate. \"xpdf","description":"xpdf PDF 查看器客户端 0.91 之前版本在处理 PDF 文档中嵌入的 URL 时，未对 URL 中的 shell 元字符进行正确过滤和转义，导致在调用系统浏览器打开 URL 时执行了恶意命令。攻击者可通过构造包含特殊字符的恶意 PDF 文件，诱使用户打开后触发命令执行。该漏洞影响 xpdf 0.91 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0727"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21.320","remediation":"立即升级 xpdf 至 0.91 及以上版本，该版本修复了内嵌 URL 的 shell 元字符过滤问题。对于 Debian/Red Hat/Caldera 等发行版用户，请安装对应厂商提供的安全更新补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 xpdf 内嵌 URL 自动启动浏览器的功能（移除或注释相关配置项）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96766355023239&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96886599829687&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-031.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000910a","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1624","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0727","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0727.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9jjv-62gr-rmvp/GHSA-9jjv-62gr-rmvp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013